cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this research overlay or its manuscript reproducibility package,
  please cite this software and the full Git commit SHA used in your analysis.
  Please also cite the underlying frameworks listed in the README.
type: software
title: Integrated 5G NR-V2X and Sionna RT Co-Simulation with ns-3 and SUMO
authors:
  - family-names: Fizulin
    given-names: Andrey
repository-code: https://github.com/CAVISE-RnD/Sionna_SUMO_simu
url: https://github.com/CAVISE-RnD/Sionna_SUMO_simu
abstract: >-
  Research overlay integrating ns-3, 5G NR-V2X, Sionna RT, and SUMO for
  connected vehicle communication and behavior analysis. Includes simulator
  sources, experiment configurations, and a package for reanalyzing the
  retained emergency-vehicle alert and intersection manuscript data.
keywords:
  - ns-3
  - 5G NR-V2X
  - Sionna RT
  - SUMO
  - co-simulation
  - connected vehicles
  - reproducibility
